Ah, benarkah?

444
00:29:49.705 --> 00:29:51.164
Oke, sampai jumpa lagi.

445
00:29:53.125 --> 00:29:55.085
Nona Yoo bilang dia akan mengambil alkoholnya.

446
00:29:55.168 --> 00:29:56.211
Ah, benarkah?

447
00:29:56.837 --> 00:29:59.131
