Maukah Anda memberi ruang di tengah?

502
00:32:19.563 --> 00:32:21.231
-[Wonseok] Siap?
-[MS. Oh] Siap.

503
00:32:21.314 --> 00:32:23.316
Inilah Pintu Kebenaran.

504
00:32:23.400 --> 00:32:24.442
[MS. Oh] Putar!

505
00:32:25.777 --> 00:32:27.320
[semua berseru]

506
00:32:27.404 --> 00:32:28.446
Apa-apaan ini?

507
00:32:29.114 --> 00:32:30.157
[Wonseok] Pertanyaanmu adalah,

508
00:32:30.240 --> 00:32:34.327
Saya stres
karena kencan butaku, ya atau tidak?

509
00:32:35.871 --> 00:32:37.664
-TIDAK.
-Melihat?

510
00:32:37.747 --> 00:32:39.374
