527
00:33:18.538 --> 00:33:21.666
[berdeham] Aku punya pacar,

528
00:33:21.750 --> 00:33:23.126
ya atau tidak?

529
00:33:23.543 --> 00:33:25.170
[semuanya meniru drum roll]

530
00:33:26.421 --> 00:33:27.464
Jawabannya adalah...

531
00:33:28.673 --> 00:33:29.716
saya akan minum.

532
00:33:29.799 --> 00:33:31.968
