-[Ny. Oh] Tuan Kim bisa minum.
-[Wonseok] Dia peminum berat.

569
00:35:00.890 --> 00:35:01.933
Tuan Kim.

570
00:35:04.394 --> 00:35:05.604
Ada apa?

571
