632
00:37:41.968 --> 00:37:43.678
-Ini perusahaan kami.
- [Meri terkikik]

633
00:37:44.763 --> 00:37:45.805
[Wonseok] Itu gila.

634
00:37:46.139 --> 00:37:47.390
[Songhee terkekeh]

635
00:37:48.016 --> 00:37:49.184
Tekanan darahku...

636
00:37:49.267 --> 00:37:50.643
Ini gila.

637
